{"about_the_game":"<strong>This is the free Prologue of Crack it Up! <br>In this version, you will be able to complete your first collection and experience the main mechanics of the game. <br>Don't forget to add the complete game to your wishlist to get notified when the game is released!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/87d1ee7c06f64dc82db7dd3b7d6bb3f4.avif?t=1729062778\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Use your computer to order different types of booster packs from an online store. Open one pack after another in this relaxing card collection game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/8f0dcb3c3590e698dd1d2943f50c23a3.poster.avif?t=1729062778\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/8f0dcb3c3590e698dd1d2943f50c23a3.webm?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/8f0dcb3c3590e698dd1d2943f50c23a3.mp4?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Buy packs from different collections.<br></li><li> Premium booster packs with high chance of exclusive rare variants.<br></li><li> Booster boxes with a lot of packs for less money.<br></li><li> Relaxing pack opening gameplay.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/712f51fee1c3dd8cb2c5ce8982295231.avif?t=1729062778\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>As an avid card collector, you will end up with a big collection of cards, sell your duplicates and your rarest cards for profit in a webpage. Manage your economy and get the best deals in a changing trading card market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/69cfdc7a6136d549f16a1e6836281127.poster.avif?t=1729062778\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/69cfdc7a6136d549f16a1e6836281127.webm?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/69cfdc7a6136d549f16a1e6836281127.mp4?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use your retro computer to sell cards in an online store.<br></li><li> A dynamic card market, the price of the cards change over time, sell at the right time to maximize your profit.<br></li><li> Manage your economy, \u00bfWill you sell that rare card for a lot of money or will you keep it for your collection?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/2e2820ef4688daa17a2f6563254a3e94.avif?t=1729062778\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>As a card collecting enthusiast you will have different collections to complete, each one with hundreds of cards and rare variants with high value.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/bf986be2d6b8c6d1ba728efb3a1b423e.poster.avif?t=1729062778\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/bf986be2d6b8c6d1ba728efb3a1b423e.webm?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/bf986be2d6b8c6d1ba728efb3a1b423e.mp4?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Complete up to 5 different card collections.<br></li><li> Hundreds of cards with rare variants.<br></li><li> Scroll through your collection albums and inspect your precious trading cards.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017090?t=1729062778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729062778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729062778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729062778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>This is the free Prologue of Crack it Up! <br>In this version, you will be able to complete your first collection and experience the main mechanics of the game. <br>Don't forget to add the complete game to your wishlist to get notified when the game is released!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/87d1ee7c06f64dc82db7dd3b7d6bb3f4.avif?t=1729062778\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Use your computer to order different types of booster packs from an online store. Open one pack after another in this relaxing card collection game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/8f0dcb3c3590e698dd1d2943f50c23a3.poster.avif?t=1729062778\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017090/extras/8f0dcb3c3590e698dd1d2943f50c23a3.webm?t=1729062778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src